<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia bought 50,000 tonnes U.S. corn - trade.</title>
<headline>Tunisia bought 50,000 tonnes U.S. corn - trade.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia bought two lots of U.S.-origin corn of 25,000 tonnes each at a tender on Wednesday, traders said.</p>
<p>The first lot was bought at $141.45 C&amp;F for January 1-10 shipment, and the second at $141.75 for shipment January 20-31.</p>
<p>-- Tunis newsroom, 2161-787538</p>
</text>
